# Prettier formats what the repository OWNS. Everything below is either
# generated, vendored, or a scratch checkout that is not part of the tree.
#
# `.claude/worktrees/` is here for the same reason it is in `eslint.config.mjs`:
# a worktree is a full checkout of this repository nested inside it. Formatting
# one rewrites an agent's in-flight work behind its back, and a single scratch
# checkout accounted for 1186 of the 1187 files `pnpm format:check` complained
# about — which means the check had stopped being able to say anything about
# the code it exists to judge.

